# {{name}}

An MCP server built with [FastMCP](https://github.com/jlowin/fastmcp).

## Quick Start

```bash
uv sync
uv run {{pythonModuleName}}
```

## Testing with MCP Inspector

```bash
npx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector uv run {{pythonModuleName}}
```

## Add to Claude Desktop

{{#if (eq transport "stdio")}}
Add this to your Claude Desktop config (`~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{name}}": {
      "command": "uv",
      "args": ["--directory", "/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/{{name}}", "run", "{{pythonModuleName}}"]
    }
  }
}
```
{{else}}
Start the server, then configure your MCP client to connect to:

```
http://localhost:8000/mcp
```
{{/if}}

## Adding New Tools

Add a new tool in `src/{{pythonModuleName}}/tools/__init__.py`:

```python
@mcp.tool()
def my_tool(param: str) -> str:
    """Description of my tool."""
    return f"Result: {param}"
```

## Scripts

- `uv run {{pythonModuleName}}` — Start the server
- `uv run pytest` — Run tests

